      <title>Anthropic Claude 接入 CarPlay，用户开车时可直接语音对话</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/gpt/post/20260904/Anthropic-Claude-%E6%8E%A5%E5%85%A5-CarPlay%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E5%BC%80%E8%BD%A6%E6%97%B6%E5%8F%AF%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%AF%AD%E9%9F%B3%E5%AF%B9%E8%AF%9D/</link>
